  "description": "Gorgeous move-in ready colonial in the highly desirable Wolf Trap Downs community, nestled in a lovely cul-de-sac. A welcoming two-story foyer opens to formal living and dining rooms and a private office. The gourmet kitchen showcases quartz countertops, stainless appliances and a large center island with cooktop, with easy access to the breakfast room. The family room is highlighted by a floor-to-ceiling stone fireplace. Upstairs, a spacious owner&rsquo;s suite with sitting area is joined by three additional bedrooms, two full baths and the laundry room. The finished walk-out lower level offers a large recreation room with fireplace and wet bar, a fifth bedroom, full bath, storage and access to a covered patio. Outside, a spacious deck overlooks the private, tree-lined, fully fenced backyard.",
